{"parse": {"title": "Anniversary Dragon Balls", "pageid": 4084, "revid": 37263, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>-Anniversary island has been removed, the starry balls are not tradeable-</b>\n</p><p>Anniversary Starry Balls are mythic items obtained by opening Anniversary stars with a very low chance (chance has not been revealed yet), or completing the Anniversary Island stage (The Anniversary Island can be completed once every day). When you have collected all 7 Starry Balls, you can use them to summon Shenro in the lobby. You will keep the dragon balls until you wish for something.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/12/Shenron.png/revision/latest?cb=20230718124640\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Shenro [AA Update 15 Anniversary Event]\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/12/Shenron.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20230718124640\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"98\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Shenron.png\" data-image-key=\"Shenron.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Shenron.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Shenro [AA Update 15 Anniversary Event]</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The wishes you get to choose are:\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Wish for:\n</th>\n<th>Reward\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Riches\n</td>\n<td>x5000 <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest?cb=20250109022450\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20250109022450\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Power\n</td>\n<td>x50 <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/fd/Star_Remnant.png/revision/latest?cb=20250102035557\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Star Remnant\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/fd/Star_Remnant.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20250102035557\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Star Remnant.png\" data-image-key=\"Star_Remnant.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Allies\n</td>\n<td><dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Issai\" title=\"Issai\"><img alt=\"Dragon Knight\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"101\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dragon Knight.png\" data-image-key=\"Dragon_Knight.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/4e/Dragon_Knight.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/101?cb=20250822214835\" /></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Issai</div></dd>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261023123120\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.112 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.120 seconds\nPreproces